  "details": "I have run into a lot of people running VRChat on hardware that isn't powerful enough to run VRChat. Raising the minimum and recommended specs on Steam might give people a better idea on the type of computer they need to run VRChat on a computer without issues. I hope you will consider my suggestion thanks Ozzy\n\nmy suggestion\n\nMinimum and recommended specs for running VRChat: \n\nIntel Core i5-11400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600\n\n16GB of RAM\n\nNVIDIA RTX 3060 12GB / AMD RX 7600 XT 16GB",
